Authentic Meitei emotional lo-fi ballad: haunting bowed Pena solo, hand-played Pung entering softly, warm room tone and tape grain. Mature Meitei female vocals use natural phrasing, ornamentation and subtle vibrato. Sparse vocal-Pena call-and-response; restrained breakdown adds low, intimate English rap. Final chorus intensifies, ending with Pena, fading hum and soft Pung.

